WEBVTT

01:18.430 --> 01:21.789
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.900 --> 01:24.870
[Episode 27]

01:44.410 --> 01:45.610
Isn't this my laptop?

01:48.360 --> 01:51.090
Were you the one
who played that video last night?

01:53.180 --> 01:55.380
Have you figured out how to thank me yet?

02:00.160 --> 02:01.880
When did you

02:02.110 --> 02:03.610
find out my exact plan?

02:06.260 --> 02:07.420
And when did you

02:07.440 --> 02:08.930
steal my laptop

02:09.150 --> 02:10.810
and do all this behind my back?

02:11.810 --> 02:12.750
Did you eavesdrop on

02:12.750 --> 02:14.220
my conversation with Wang Ruohai?

02:14.220 --> 02:15.580
Did the USB drive I gave Wang Ruohai

02:15.580 --> 02:16.710
end up with you?

02:23.730 --> 02:24.290
What?

02:25.760 --> 02:27.720
What are you talking about?

02:29.570 --> 02:31.770
Eavesdropping on your conversation
with Wang Ruohai?

02:31.770 --> 02:33.350
Why would I do that?

02:35.710 --> 02:37.740
I just have foresight.

02:38.070 --> 02:39.090
I knew from the start

02:39.090 --> 02:40.890
that your tricks wouldn't work.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.630
Good thing Zhao De was there.

02:43.920 --> 02:45.430
Without his skills,

02:45.460 --> 02:48.860
you couldn't even connect
to the big screen's signal source.

02:50.670 --> 02:52.200
And yet you keep talking about

02:52.200 --> 02:53.390
Wang Ruohai.

02:53.470 --> 02:54.370
Do you really rely on

02:54.370 --> 02:55.870
that coward Wang Ruohai?

02:56.500 --> 02:57.550
You believe him

02:57.680 --> 02:59.670
rather than your own teacher!

03:02.220 --> 03:04.220
I know you helped me.

03:05.060 --> 03:06.320
But I don't know why...

03:08.860 --> 03:10.140
why I...

03:11.990 --> 03:14.080
I don't really want to thank you.

03:14.110 --> 03:15.340
I don't know if it's your problem

03:15.340 --> 03:16.140
or mine.

03:16.140 --> 03:17.340
I can't figure it out.

03:39.230 --> 03:40.280
Don't be mad!

03:53.340 --> 03:54.230
Let me tell you.

03:55.270 --> 03:56.700
Don't think you can just go upstairs

03:56.700 --> 03:58.160
and resume work smoothly.

03:58.390 --> 03:59.500
For Fang Yun,

03:59.710 --> 04:00.840
only the useful ones

04:01.270 --> 04:02.870
can secure their positions.

04:03.310 --> 04:04.020
When you go up later,

04:04.020 --> 04:06.750
she will definitely ask
how you plan to follow up,

04:07.070 --> 04:07.920
so she can take the credit.

04:07.920 --> 04:08.700
Got it?

04:09.170 --> 04:11.280
Do you think all bosses are like you?

04:12.270 --> 04:12.750
Okay.

04:13.190 --> 04:14.850
She might not take the credit.

04:14.950 --> 04:15.950
But if you don't figure out

04:15.950 --> 04:16.950
how to follow up,

04:16.950 --> 04:19.040
she will definitely scold you
for not having a plan.

04:19.040 --> 04:20.300
How do you know I don't?

04:21.589 --> 04:22.970
Your IQ has improved.

04:23.110 --> 04:24.310
Just not very stable.

04:31.890 --> 04:32.650
Shiyu.

04:34.090 --> 04:35.490
When you were little,

04:37.190 --> 04:39.650
I really didn't pay
enough attention to you.

04:40.530 --> 04:42.610
We failed as parents,

04:43.659 --> 04:45.310
making you bear

04:45.490 --> 04:47.420
the struggles of growing up alone.

04:48.460 --> 04:49.100
Dad.

04:49.750 --> 04:51.290
You don't need to blame yourself.

04:51.290 --> 04:52.950
I'm completely fine now.

04:53.030 --> 04:54.330
I'm bringing this up today

04:54.330 --> 04:55.540
just to say that

04:55.630 --> 04:57.420
in my darkest days,

04:58.170 --> 05:00.430
it was Wang Ruohai who pulled me through.

05:01.110 --> 05:02.230
He encouraged me

05:02.850 --> 05:05.590
and gave me hope for life again.

05:06.520 --> 05:07.990
That was also when I

05:08.090 --> 05:09.420
fell in love with him.

05:11.460 --> 05:14.300
So after you got your master's degree,

05:14.330 --> 05:15.860
you insisted on coming back

05:15.920 --> 05:17.130
just to find him?

05:19.180 --> 05:19.750
Yes.

05:20.540 --> 05:22.980
It's a pity we were destined to meet,

05:23.510 --> 05:25.310
but not destined to be together.

05:26.090 --> 05:27.290
Does Wang Ruohai know

05:27.310 --> 05:28.770
that you came back for him?

05:32.659 --> 05:33.370
Shiyu,

05:34.340 --> 05:35.480
if you had told him,

05:35.690 --> 05:37.490
maybe he wouldn't have left you.

05:38.930 --> 05:40.040
There's no need.

05:41.190 --> 05:43.730
Even if we were together,

05:44.020 --> 05:45.680
we wouldn't last long anyway.

05:49.890 --> 05:51.020
What about Qian Fei?

05:51.630 --> 05:53.730
She is Wang Ruohai's ex-girlfriend.

05:54.220 --> 05:55.870
Will hiring her

05:55.980 --> 05:58.320
affect you in any way?

05:59.750 --> 06:01.210
What impact could it have?

06:01.400 --> 06:04.230
Qian Fei is capable and strategic.

06:04.330 --> 06:06.390
She'll be good for Shanlifang's IPO.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.940
As for Wang Ruohai,

06:09.020 --> 06:11.340
he was indeed a ray of light to me once.

06:12.300 --> 06:14.450
But in terms of vision and pattern,

06:15.560 --> 06:17.760
Shanlifang's future doesn't need him.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.950
And my future

06:21.030 --> 06:22.430
doesn't need him either.

06:28.420 --> 06:29.270
Shiyu.

06:29.900 --> 06:30.450
Dad.

06:31.220 --> 06:32.280
I'm so lucky

06:33.659 --> 06:35.120
to have you as my daughter.

06:45.120 --> 06:47.380
I still remember when you were little...

06:50.750 --> 06:51.960
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

06:57.690 --> 06:58.820
You guys go in first.

07:01.590 --> 07:03.190
Do you know what to say later?

07:06.100 --> 07:06.820
At present,

07:06.840 --> 07:08.750
the asset and financial restructuring
of Shanlifang

07:08.750 --> 07:10.660
has basically achieved
its predetermined goals.

07:10.660 --> 07:14.160
And the evaluation data
of land, assets, and real estate

07:14.270 --> 07:16.310
has also reached
the final verification stage.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.500
We can take advantage of the opportunity

07:17.500 --> 07:18.980
to build public opinion at the banquet.

07:18.980 --> 07:19.870
For one thing,

07:19.900 --> 07:22.430
we can get rid of the impact
caused by online public opinion.

07:22.430 --> 07:23.140
For another,

07:23.140 --> 07:24.950
we can increase
the tracking of key customers

07:24.950 --> 07:26.960
to strive for more project capital.

07:27.020 --> 07:29.020
And in terms of other businesses...

07:30.390 --> 07:30.990
Very good.

07:31.780 --> 07:32.430
Not bad.

07:32.450 --> 07:34.180
It seems you are well prepared.

07:35.630 --> 07:36.900
All right, just say it like that.

07:36.900 --> 07:38.950
As for whether Shanlifang adopts it,

07:38.950 --> 07:40.280
that's their business.

07:41.870 --> 07:42.390
Okay.

07:42.890 --> 07:44.590
[Staff Card]

07:44.700 --> 07:45.700
Don't be nervous.

07:47.030 --> 07:48.090
Just make it clear.

07:51.100 --> 07:54.159
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

07:54.200 --> 07:56.320
[Land Value Increment Tax]

08:19.740 --> 08:21.930
And participate
in the formulation and implementation

08:21.930 --> 08:23.260
of quality management standards.

08:23.260 --> 08:25.000
These are some of my thoughts

08:25.030 --> 08:27.490
on the follow-up processing
of this matter.

08:35.830 --> 08:37.330
The working ability of He Jing's employees

08:37.330 --> 08:38.650
is indeed amazing.

08:38.740 --> 08:40.710
Miss Qian, you're able to sort out

08:40.740 --> 08:42.070
the group's situation
so clearly and thoroughly

08:42.070 --> 08:44.030
in such a short time.

08:44.150 --> 08:46.130
We highly appreciate it.

08:46.190 --> 08:47.870
As for the suggestions
Miss Qian just made,

08:47.870 --> 08:50.670
I hope everyone will organize
and discuss them soon.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.380
If the PR and publicity departments

08:52.380 --> 08:54.040
have no further suggestions,

08:54.150 --> 08:56.080
we will start the implementation.

08:56.150 --> 08:58.340
Especially the personnel of each PR group

08:58.340 --> 08:59.380
and the functional departments

08:59.380 --> 09:01.150
should immediately start working on it.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.550
Outsourced work shall be carried out

09:02.550 --> 09:04.070
in strict compliance
with the confidentiality agreement.

09:04.070 --> 09:04.880
We will hold

09:05.030 --> 09:08.030
a coordination meeting
as soon as possible in the future.

09:08.030 --> 09:10.430
Miss Qian, do you have
anything else to add?

09:10.550 --> 09:11.220
I have nothing to add.

09:11.220 --> 09:11.820
Thank you.

09:12.830 --> 09:14.500
Alright, thank you all for your hard work.

09:14.500 --> 09:15.580
That's all for today.

09:15.580 --> 09:17.550
Okay, the meeting is over.

09:21.620 --> 09:22.930
You are doing well now.

09:22.980 --> 09:24.180
You're very capable.

09:26.460 --> 09:27.550
A year ago,

09:27.620 --> 09:28.760
in front of Liao Shiyu,

09:28.760 --> 09:30.620
you might have acted like a clown.

09:30.780 --> 09:31.760
But now,

09:31.780 --> 09:33.380
you can fight her

09:33.380 --> 09:34.550
on equal terms.

09:38.550 --> 09:40.040
I really want to know

09:40.190 --> 09:42.310
who exactly made you like this.

09:43.980 --> 09:45.130
You, of course.

09:46.950 --> 09:49.710
Flattery. I didn't teach you that.

09:53.150 --> 09:55.280
I believe you already know the answer.

10:03.080 --> 10:10.140
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

10:11.070 --> 10:17.330
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

10:18.050 --> 10:24.360
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

10:24.910 --> 10:26.660
What are you doing?
Why are you plugging in a USB drive?

10:25.870 --> 10:31.700
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

10:27.000 --> 10:29.690
Stop watching dramas.
You should actually study something.

10:29.690 --> 10:31.860
[Please enter your passcode
to unlock this drive]

10:30.910 --> 10:32.150
These are my personal notes

10:32.150 --> 10:34.150
from doing projects over the years.

10:32.190 --> 10:36.050
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

10:32.410 --> 10:32.790
[Private Notes]

10:34.670 --> 10:35.870
Study them properly.

10:37.070 --> 10:38.330
Trying to act all mature again.

10:38.330 --> 10:40.180
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

10:38.550 --> 10:39.950
Fine, don't take it then.

10:40.030 --> 10:40.580
Don't move.

10:40.550 --> 10:44.700
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

10:40.880 --> 10:42.540
Finger-breaking technique.

10:43.020 --> 10:43.900
Immature.

10:45.700 --> 10:47.200
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

10:45.980 --> 10:47.220
Let's see how capable you are.

10:47.220 --> 10:48.790
We don't even know if you can master them.

10:47.900 --> 10:51.860
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

10:51.870 --> 10:52.880
[I didn't eat your fried rice for free.
As your teacher, I helped you]

10:52.880 --> 10:54.500
[improve your document.
Consider it my payment for the meal.]

10:52.930 --> 10:54.490
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

10:55.150 --> 10:59.130
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

10:59.740 --> 11:01.740
Leaving your post without permission
during work hours—

11:00.070 --> 11:03.810
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

11:01.810 --> 11:03.070
who gave you the nerve?

11:04.150 --> 11:06.010
You're my special assistant now.

11:06.310 --> 11:08.100
During working hours,
you are to be on standby at all times

11:08.100 --> 11:09.630
and keep your phone on 24/7.

11:10.150 --> 11:12.460
You don't even know something this basic?

11:12.460 --> 11:13.370
We have you on standby,

11:13.370 --> 11:14.780
so that Director Fang and I

11:14.780 --> 11:16.640
can find you whenever we need you.

11:16.740 --> 11:18.690
From now on,
anything outside the scope of your duties

11:18.690 --> 11:19.610
is off-limits!

11:19.380 --> 11:26.280
♪ What I dream of is being with you ♪

11:20.670 --> 11:22.820
I owe everyone an apology.

11:23.380 --> 11:24.780
The materials I prepared

11:24.790 --> 11:25.460
were actually—

11:25.460 --> 11:26.120
Taken by me.

11:27.140 --> 11:32.930
♪ Hand in hand,
taking life at an easy pace ♪

11:27.550 --> 11:28.310
Sorry.

11:28.330 --> 11:29.860
I forgot to give them to you.

11:33.860 --> 11:40.000
♪ What I wish for
is something that lasts ♪

11:37.010 --> 11:37.650
[Efficient Operation] [Transnational
Operation] [Sci-tech Innovation]

11:41.030 --> 11:42.340
Yeah.

11:41.550 --> 11:47.520
♪ Day by day, holding you close
in a life that's simple and true ♪

11:43.070 --> 11:44.870
Why did I make him worry about me?

11:46.080 --> 11:47.910
After I met him,

11:47.960 --> 11:51.270
he helped me revise my research report,
went to Sichuan with me,

11:48.390 --> 11:52.250
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

11:52.420 --> 11:54.410
guided me in my work,

11:53.050 --> 11:56.320
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

11:55.120 --> 11:57.190
and even stood up for me emotionally.

11:56.680 --> 12:00.990
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

12:01.940 --> 12:03.510
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

12:03.970 --> 12:08.150
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

12:04.640 --> 12:05.720
Could it be...

12:07.400 --> 12:09.490
Impossible. I'm overthinking.

12:09.170 --> 12:10.760
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

12:09.700 --> 12:11.470
He just treats me as his landlady.

12:11.240 --> 12:15.350
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

12:11.790 --> 12:14.950
However, to have a good friend
who constantly urges me on

12:14.980 --> 12:16.790
and helps me by my side,

12:16.050 --> 12:20.060
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

12:16.810 --> 12:18.130
I am truly lucky.

12:18.340 --> 12:20.100
And my ticket home.

12:20.340 --> 12:23.580
I really need to thank Li Yifei properly.

12:25.850 --> 12:29.920
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

12:30.690 --> 12:34.230
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

12:35.430 --> 12:37.130
I took another ugly photo of you.

12:37.130 --> 12:37.560
Look.

12:38.620 --> 12:39.720
I have

12:40.070 --> 12:41.670
asked the Director for time off.

12:41.670 --> 12:42.710
I can go home for the Spring Festival

12:42.710 --> 12:43.500
2 days early.

12:45.150 --> 12:47.310
I haven't thought about
the Spring Festival yet.

12:47.310 --> 12:48.100
It's all because

12:48.100 --> 12:50.300
the flight you booked for me is earlier.

12:50.310 --> 12:51.460
If I can't reschedule the flight
and get back on time,

12:51.460 --> 12:52.640
it'll be trouble.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.100
So I had to bite the bullet

12:54.100 --> 12:56.760
and ask for leave
right after returning to work.

12:57.580 --> 12:59.070
Taking credit

12:59.750 --> 13:01.950
and taking advantage of the situation.

13:02.100 --> 13:02.810
What?

13:04.950 --> 13:05.620
Nothing.

13:13.260 --> 13:13.970
Qian Fei,

13:14.340 --> 13:15.560
I actually wanted to say...

13:15.560 --> 13:17.860
You wanted to say congratulations, right?

13:17.860 --> 13:18.830
How about this?

13:18.910 --> 13:21.210
I'll go grocery shopping tonight

13:21.380 --> 13:22.450
and make you a big feast.

13:22.450 --> 13:23.710
Thank you so much for all this time,

13:23.710 --> 13:25.390
my Li Yifei, Young Master Li,

13:25.460 --> 13:27.550
and my good teacher and buddy,

13:27.550 --> 13:29.750
for always encouraging and helping me.

13:30.340 --> 13:31.190
Good teacher?

13:32.310 --> 13:33.100
Good buddy?

13:33.860 --> 13:34.530
Exactly.

13:34.580 --> 13:36.860
Just like Yu and Jingjing.

13:36.910 --> 13:39.340
You are all very important to me.

13:39.500 --> 13:40.950
I thank God

13:40.980 --> 13:42.260
for bringing you into my life.

13:42.260 --> 13:43.260
I'm really lucky.

13:46.860 --> 13:47.460
All right.

13:48.460 --> 13:50.460
Since you're full of

13:50.460 --> 13:51.810
words of gratitude,

13:53.030 --> 13:54.760
I'll take this "nice guy" card.

13:55.100 --> 13:55.810
Then think about

13:55.810 --> 13:56.950
what you want to eat tonight.

13:56.950 --> 13:58.350
Order whatever you want.

13:59.430 --> 14:01.760
I don't have anything particular in mind.

14:02.030 --> 14:03.310
You don't have an appetite?

14:03.310 --> 14:03.990
No.

14:04.950 --> 14:06.230
I mean,

14:06.500 --> 14:07.900
as long as you cook for me,

14:07.990 --> 14:09.320
I'm fine with anything.

14:11.580 --> 14:13.000
I'm a bit touched.

14:14.260 --> 14:15.410
Put it away.

14:16.500 --> 14:18.630
We're not suited for touching scenes.

14:20.120 --> 14:20.690
Think about

14:20.690 --> 14:22.290
what you want to eat tonight.

14:22.710 --> 14:24.240
Don't you want to rip me off?

14:25.510 --> 14:26.720
Premium sea urchin.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.950
Tell me, Jun has been

14:30.950 --> 14:32.380
quite normal these days, right?

14:32.380 --> 14:33.090
Right, right.

14:33.090 --> 14:33.950
Then tell me,

14:33.980 --> 14:35.920
if they really talk it out

14:36.740 --> 14:38.880
and become ordinary friends,

14:38.970 --> 14:39.950
that'll be pretty nice.

14:39.950 --> 14:40.670
Ms. Yu.

14:41.040 --> 14:43.040
Look, it's that person from before.

14:46.100 --> 14:47.060
Dang, Dang.

14:48.430 --> 14:49.870
It really is her.

15:02.950 --> 15:06.510
[Bathroom]

15:10.740 --> 15:11.800
Did you just finish using the bathroom?

15:11.800 --> 15:12.940
[Bathroom]

15:14.180 --> 15:15.440
I need to use it as well.

15:15.660 --> 15:17.750
[Bathroom]

15:16.420 --> 15:16.990
Go ahead.

15:22.710 --> 15:23.660
Tell me,

15:23.800 --> 15:24.540
well,

15:24.790 --> 15:27.650
if Jun really clears things up with Dang,

15:28.340 --> 15:29.960
why isn't he moving back in?

15:31.610 --> 15:32.920
I think he probably

15:33.710 --> 15:36.170
hasn't moved on
from this relationship yet.

15:38.450 --> 15:40.890
Anyway, my bottom line is,

15:41.380 --> 15:42.790
his partner must have local residency.

15:42.790 --> 15:44.580
Non-locals are absolutely
out of the question.

15:44.580 --> 15:46.070
-I agree with you on that.
-As for character,

15:46.070 --> 15:48.170
at the very least,
she should be like Dang.

15:48.170 --> 15:49.170
Right, right.

15:52.420 --> 15:53.420
Uncle, Auntie.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.030
Dang.

15:58.030 --> 15:58.670
Well,

15:59.310 --> 16:00.330
what a coincidence.

16:00.330 --> 16:01.860
-Yes, it's a coincidence.
-It's really a coincidence.

16:01.860 --> 16:03.310
We were just, well...

16:03.980 --> 16:04.740
Taking a walk after dinner.

16:04.740 --> 16:05.980
Yes, taking a walk.

16:07.860 --> 16:09.100
Running into you once or twice a day

16:09.100 --> 16:10.700
can be called a coincidence.

16:11.070 --> 16:13.700
But the third time
seems a bit like stalking.

16:14.220 --> 16:16.030
Impossible. I wouldn't follow you.

16:16.030 --> 16:16.580
Right.

16:16.740 --> 16:17.270
Right?

16:17.380 --> 16:19.500
If I were following you,

16:19.500 --> 16:21.030
and if Jun found out,

16:21.150 --> 16:22.820
wouldn't he cut ties with me?

16:23.370 --> 16:24.540
Don't worry.

16:24.830 --> 16:26.960
He definitely won't cut ties with you.

16:28.260 --> 16:30.070
And we've already cleared things up.

16:30.070 --> 16:32.400
We'll just be regular friends from now on.

16:32.950 --> 16:33.920
You two talked?

16:33.950 --> 16:34.590
Friends?

16:36.550 --> 16:38.810
Uncle, Auntie, I need to get back to work.

16:42.580 --> 16:44.110
You have to admit, this girl

16:44.740 --> 16:46.100
is so busy working in Shanghai

16:46.100 --> 16:47.430
and even has several part-time jobs.

16:47.430 --> 16:48.690
She works really hard.

16:49.980 --> 16:51.380
You know, Shanghai girls

16:52.350 --> 16:53.330
aren't this...

16:53.390 --> 16:55.920
No, I mean out-of-town girls.

16:55.950 --> 16:57.320
If she didn't work hard,

16:57.500 --> 16:59.590
what else could she do? Right?

17:00.670 --> 17:02.220
It would be so nice

17:02.220 --> 17:04.220
if she were a local girl in Shanghai.

17:22.980 --> 17:24.260
You didn't go to work?

17:25.390 --> 17:26.990
Aren't you going home today?

17:27.630 --> 17:29.490
What does that have to do with you?

17:32.280 --> 17:33.820
Don't be ungrateful.

17:34.500 --> 17:35.670
I offered to drop you off at the airport

17:35.670 --> 17:36.910
and carry your luggage.

17:36.910 --> 17:38.060
Shouldn't you shed tears of gratitude

17:38.060 --> 17:39.590
and thank your lucky stars?

17:41.060 --> 17:42.790
Come on, I'll give you a chance.

17:43.110 --> 17:44.480
Gather your emotions

17:44.640 --> 17:46.100
and give me a new reaction.

17:47.500 --> 17:49.300
Are you taking me to the airport?

17:50.120 --> 17:51.520
Are you really that kind?

17:52.670 --> 17:54.470
Is it just pure humanistic care?

17:56.700 --> 17:58.080
Why do I feel scared?

17:58.220 --> 18:00.020
Wait, what are you afraid of?

18:01.630 --> 18:02.910
Anyway, you being so attentive

18:02.910 --> 18:03.910
just isn't right.

18:04.460 --> 18:06.690
I think it's very suspicious.

18:08.260 --> 18:09.050
Tell me,

18:09.140 --> 18:10.470
what do you need from me?

18:13.110 --> 18:14.500
I know.

18:16.020 --> 18:17.900
Are you waiting for me to leave,

18:18.190 --> 18:19.670
to bring
your internet celebrity girlfriend

18:19.670 --> 18:21.270
to stay here for the New Year?

18:22.190 --> 18:24.320
What internet celebrity girlfriend?

18:27.190 --> 18:28.160
You mean Jinzi?

18:28.870 --> 18:30.350
She's not my girlfriend at all.

18:30.350 --> 18:31.630
I don't have a girlfriend.

18:31.630 --> 18:33.980
You're still making excuses
and refusing to confess.

18:33.980 --> 18:34.710
Gosh.

18:34.910 --> 18:36.370
I can even put up with you,

18:36.540 --> 18:38.340
so what else can't I work around?

18:38.710 --> 18:39.350
However,

18:39.420 --> 18:40.870
I'm kindly reminding you.

18:40.870 --> 18:42.530
You'd better be neat and tidy.

18:42.540 --> 18:43.950
Don't make the house too messy,

18:43.950 --> 18:44.870
or I'll get mad at you.

18:44.870 --> 18:46.070
Don't talk nonsense.

18:46.590 --> 18:48.770
Why are you making wild guesses?

18:49.500 --> 18:51.050
Aren't I doing a good deed?

18:51.110 --> 18:53.110
Since you can't go home for the New Year,

18:53.110 --> 18:55.310
I have to give you two some private time.

18:57.710 --> 18:59.220
Why did you hit so hard?

19:01.670 --> 19:02.650
I'm leaving.

19:03.670 --> 19:04.670
I'll walk you out.

19:07.780 --> 19:08.400
Wait.

19:09.950 --> 19:11.220
I simply want to see you off.

19:11.220 --> 19:12.750
I have no other intentions.

19:19.540 --> 19:20.260
What exactly

19:20.260 --> 19:21.350
is in your suitcase?

19:21.350 --> 19:22.150
It's so heavy.

19:22.150 --> 19:24.020
My arm is about to break from carrying it.

19:24.020 --> 19:25.380
You volunteered to carry it.

19:25.380 --> 19:26.430
I didn't beg you.

19:26.600 --> 19:27.550
All right, all right.

19:27.550 --> 19:29.240
I asked for it and brought it upon myself.

19:29.240 --> 19:30.240
Are you happy now?

19:32.260 --> 19:33.670
Pleasing your girlfriend

19:33.670 --> 19:35.190
while acting as a coolie
for your landlady.

19:35.190 --> 19:36.270
You sure have it tough.

19:36.270 --> 19:37.880
Let me emphasize this to you again.

19:37.880 --> 19:39.410
Jinzi is not my girlfriend.

19:40.660 --> 19:43.520
You're playing around,
and you won't even admit it.

19:44.460 --> 19:45.730
Playing around?

19:46.540 --> 19:47.460
Can't we help each other

19:47.460 --> 19:48.500
as friends?

19:48.740 --> 19:49.540
Okay, okay.

19:49.910 --> 19:51.410
As a friend, let me

19:51.590 --> 19:52.790
say a few words.

19:52.870 --> 19:54.600
You don't need to explain to me.

19:56.350 --> 19:56.950
Right.

19:58.060 --> 19:59.870
I heard you on the phone with your friend

19:59.870 --> 20:01.870
saying your dad wants some alcohol.

20:02.710 --> 20:04.260
A friend just gave me 2 bottles of liquor.

20:04.260 --> 20:05.260
I don't really drink it.

20:05.260 --> 20:06.150
They're in the back.

20:06.150 --> 20:07.410
Take them for your dad.

20:09.390 --> 20:11.390
You're giving this liquor to my dad?

20:13.240 --> 20:13.890
Wait.

20:14.870 --> 20:16.240
I just asked you

20:16.390 --> 20:17.670
to play along with me

20:17.770 --> 20:18.760
on the phone.

20:19.220 --> 20:20.930
Now it feels too real.

20:28.390 --> 20:30.450
Alright, just take care of yourself.

20:38.950 --> 20:40.670
Don't show off.

20:41.300 --> 20:43.900
I'm busy right now.
I won't talk to you anymore.

20:44.670 --> 20:46.730
If you have something to do, go ahead.

20:47.220 --> 20:48.750
It's nothing. That was Jun.

20:49.820 --> 20:51.780
Then why did you say
"don't show off" just now?

20:51.780 --> 20:53.440
Is he making progress with Yu?

20:53.460 --> 20:54.260
How is that possible?

20:54.260 --> 20:55.460
His mother is around.

20:56.110 --> 20:57.170
But you know what,

20:57.430 --> 20:58.460
to chase after Yu,

20:58.460 --> 20:59.720
Jun actually has a way.

21:00.710 --> 21:01.680
You think so?

21:02.500 --> 21:04.670
Although there is no substantial progress
between them,

21:04.670 --> 21:05.920
I think Yu

21:05.950 --> 21:07.480
must have been moved by Jun.

21:08.110 --> 21:09.290
Really?

21:09.350 --> 21:10.060
Of course.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.410
Because Jun is sincere.

21:11.630 --> 21:12.300
Sincere?

21:13.190 --> 21:13.660
Hello.

21:13.740 --> 21:14.450
Hello.

21:17.590 --> 21:18.870
Hello, there's liquor in this suitcase.

21:18.870 --> 21:20.110
Please attach a fragile label to it.

21:20.110 --> 21:20.750
Sure.

21:26.390 --> 21:27.950
Since I accepted
these 2 bottles of liquor,

21:27.950 --> 21:29.330
you won't force me

21:29.390 --> 21:31.320
to do anything terrible, will you?

21:32.190 --> 21:33.600
Flattering yourself for a bit is enough.

21:33.600 --> 21:34.530
Don't overdo it.

21:35.150 --> 21:36.500
I never said

21:36.500 --> 21:37.950
these 2 bottles were for you.

21:37.950 --> 21:38.910
I made it very clear.

21:38.910 --> 21:40.110
They're for your dad.

21:41.460 --> 21:42.820
Then you won't force my dad

21:42.820 --> 21:44.750
to do anything terrible, will you?

21:45.500 --> 21:47.480
I will. Just you wait.

21:48.610 --> 21:49.140
[Name: Qian Fei]

21:48.750 --> 21:49.460
Thank you.

21:51.220 --> 21:53.950
What did you mean
by "a light at the end of the tunnel"?

21:53.950 --> 21:55.260
My landlady just said

21:55.590 --> 21:58.050
you and Dang Yu
aren't completely hopeless.

22:04.020 --> 22:05.460
[Zela Dance Studio]

22:08.030 --> 22:13.530
[Zela Dance Studio]

22:13.760 --> 22:16.000
[Anyway,
I see a light at the end of the tunnel.]

22:21.060 --> 22:22.320
[Of course I know.
I told you to open your heart.]

22:22.350 --> 22:23.910
[But you don't trust me.
Sincerity is key to winning a girl over.]

22:32.980 --> 22:33.880
Jun.

22:33.950 --> 22:35.390
Sorry to keep you waiting.

22:35.390 --> 22:35.780
Not at all.

22:35.780 --> 22:37.060
Sorry, I've been a bit busy lately.

22:37.060 --> 22:37.910
Sit.

22:38.540 --> 22:40.740
I heard my mom mention

22:40.740 --> 22:42.780
the district is holding
a dance competition.

22:42.780 --> 22:44.390
But from what you said,

22:44.390 --> 22:46.300
the sub-district is forming a dance team

22:46.300 --> 22:49.780
that combines street dance
and square dance.

22:49.780 --> 22:50.220
Right.

22:50.500 --> 22:52.160
You'll see when you look at it.

22:53.190 --> 22:54.460
The sub-district's dance team

22:54.460 --> 22:55.930
is mostly seniors.

22:56.300 --> 22:57.910
The district feels
this isn't enough to reflect

22:57.910 --> 22:58.820
the vitality

22:58.950 --> 23:00.350
and harmonious atmosphere
of the sub-district.

23:00.350 --> 23:01.870
So they came up with this idea

23:01.870 --> 23:03.780
of combining the old and the young.

23:03.780 --> 23:04.940
We hope you

23:04.970 --> 23:06.590
can cooperate and participate.

23:06.590 --> 23:08.260
Just send 2 instructors.

23:08.390 --> 23:09.450
We have subsidies.

23:10.390 --> 23:12.340
Time is a bit tight.

23:12.500 --> 23:14.900
We'll figure out
the rest of the personnel.

23:16.300 --> 23:17.980
It's just that our dance instructors

23:17.980 --> 23:20.980
are already fully booked
with their regular classes.

23:21.300 --> 23:21.950
Tell you what.

23:21.950 --> 23:23.300
I'll be one.

23:23.740 --> 23:24.730
As for the other,

23:24.820 --> 23:26.510
I have to ask her opinion.

23:26.820 --> 23:29.190
-Okay. Great. Great.
-Okay. Come with me.

23:29.190 --> 23:29.720
Alright.

23:31.980 --> 23:32.440
Come on.

23:38.500 --> 23:39.780
Lower your center of gravity.

23:39.780 --> 23:40.710
Then your chest.

23:40.910 --> 23:42.580
Out, back,

23:42.630 --> 23:43.300
out.

23:43.300 --> 23:44.460
Ms. Yu's class isn't over yet.

23:44.460 --> 23:45.260
Wait a moment.

23:45.540 --> 23:46.370
Adjust a bit.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.630
Let's lower our center of gravity.

23:49.630 --> 23:51.590
And try to reach my hand.

23:51.590 --> 23:53.050
Out, back.

23:53.350 --> 23:54.920
Out, back,

23:55.020 --> 23:55.980
and out again.

23:58.430 --> 23:59.590
Have some water
and wait for me for a moment.

23:59.590 --> 24:00.090
Okay.

24:04.590 --> 24:05.520
Why are you here?

24:05.870 --> 24:06.780
During your regular classes,

24:06.780 --> 24:09.040
do you always touch each other like this?

24:09.190 --> 24:11.150
Is it any of your business?
Why do you care so much?

24:11.150 --> 24:12.710
It's obvious he wanted you to touch him

24:12.710 --> 24:13.500
to take advantage of you.

24:13.500 --> 24:15.240
Why didn't you use your shoulder throw
when you should have,

24:15.240 --> 24:16.440
and only used it on me?

24:16.710 --> 24:17.460
Are you crazy?

24:17.460 --> 24:18.500
It's a regular class.

24:18.500 --> 24:19.700
Why would I throw him?

24:19.870 --> 24:20.880
A regular class?

24:21.110 --> 24:23.110
Anyway, be more careful from now on.

24:23.150 --> 24:24.750
What are you really here for?

24:25.250 --> 24:26.250
What am I here for?

24:28.740 --> 24:29.910
Jun is here

24:29.910 --> 24:31.400
to ask for our help.

24:31.420 --> 24:33.630
Isn't our district
holding a dance competition?

24:33.630 --> 24:34.110
And then,

24:34.110 --> 24:37.580
they want to combine
hip-hop and square dancing.

24:37.610 --> 24:40.340
So they asked us
to give instructions on dancing.

24:43.260 --> 24:44.650
The little girl's legs are long.

24:44.650 --> 24:45.710
How well does she dance?

24:45.710 --> 24:46.870
She dances pretty well.

24:46.870 --> 24:48.300
Poach her and invite her over.

24:48.300 --> 24:49.950
This young man looks energetic.

24:49.950 --> 24:52.430
One, two, three, four.

24:52.430 --> 24:53.740
Try to move this way.

24:53.740 --> 24:55.120
Come on, get ready.

24:55.300 --> 24:57.740
One, two, three, four.

24:57.740 --> 24:59.500
Come on, hands.

24:59.540 --> 25:01.020
When you spin your body round...

25:01.020 --> 25:03.350
Yes, your waist.

25:03.350 --> 25:05.190
Yes, a bit lower, hands a bit lower.

25:05.190 --> 25:06.000
Not bad.

25:06.110 --> 25:07.300
You're improving.

25:07.300 --> 25:09.500
Right. Don't raise your hands too high.

25:09.540 --> 25:10.590
Come on, everyone.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.780
Let's try to win the prize.

25:11.780 --> 25:12.910
Was that Jun just now?

25:12.910 --> 25:13.950
Yes, it was him.

25:14.190 --> 25:15.180
Jun left?

25:15.780 --> 25:17.120
Your son is very busy.

25:17.300 --> 25:19.560
He went to recruit hip-hop team members.

25:21.460 --> 25:24.760
So it's not just our dance style?

25:24.780 --> 25:27.130
This time, they want to diversify
the dance styles

25:27.130 --> 25:28.790
and include the hip-hop team.

25:29.060 --> 25:32.440
They just decided on
the hip-hop instructors.

25:32.630 --> 25:33.590
It's my daughter

25:33.610 --> 25:35.360
and Yu from her studio.

25:36.740 --> 25:37.720
Dang Yu?

25:46.220 --> 25:48.680
I don't care about
these 2 bottles of liquor.

25:48.740 --> 25:49.750
I just think

25:50.220 --> 25:51.130
Li

25:51.630 --> 25:53.000
values you very much.

25:54.950 --> 25:55.620
Is that so?

25:56.740 --> 25:59.070
You have to trust your own dad's judgment.

26:00.980 --> 26:02.380
You haven't even met him,

26:02.430 --> 26:04.870
and you're already saying
you have good judgment.

26:04.870 --> 26:06.200
Show me a picture of him.

26:07.300 --> 26:08.330
I'm packing up.

26:09.330 --> 26:10.990
I'm going through your phone.

26:12.870 --> 26:13.930
What are you doing?

26:17.460 --> 26:18.430
Hold on.

26:18.450 --> 26:19.900
Let me see if I have one.

26:26.710 --> 26:28.570
I don't think I've ever taken one.

26:30.740 --> 26:33.200
Ask him to take one
right now and send it over.

26:36.910 --> 26:38.040
I think there is one.

26:38.500 --> 26:39.330
Wait a sec.

26:47.870 --> 26:49.120
Let me look.

26:53.740 --> 26:54.450
Found it.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.330
Here it is.

27:00.540 --> 27:01.660
This guy...

27:01.910 --> 27:02.770
doesn't...

27:03.630 --> 27:04.920
look very handsome.

27:06.980 --> 27:08.350
I think he looks like...

27:08.500 --> 27:09.210
like...

27:09.350 --> 27:11.950
a really popular stand-up comedian
this year.

27:12.780 --> 27:13.560
Really?

27:17.190 --> 27:17.840
Fei.

27:19.110 --> 27:21.170
Is Li really your boyfriend?

27:21.740 --> 27:22.940
Are you lying to me?

27:23.740 --> 27:25.620
Why would I lie to you?

27:27.740 --> 27:30.040
When young people date nowadays,

27:30.150 --> 27:31.820
would they not have a photo together?

27:31.820 --> 27:33.880
You're just using him to brush me off.

27:43.110 --> 27:45.330
Jun, why are you back?

27:46.110 --> 27:46.710
Mom.

27:47.270 --> 27:48.270
Can I ask you

27:48.300 --> 27:49.670
not to bother Dang Yu anymore?

27:49.670 --> 27:51.260
It will really make her awkward.

27:51.260 --> 27:52.670
I've told you many times.

27:52.670 --> 27:54.600
I will pursue my own relationship.

27:54.670 --> 27:55.870
I don't want her to think

27:55.870 --> 27:57.870
that I'm really a mama's boy, okay?

27:59.460 --> 28:00.590
Watch your attitude.

28:00.590 --> 28:02.450
How could you say that to your mom?

28:03.220 --> 28:04.400
You finally came back once

28:04.400 --> 28:06.200
just to make your mom angry, huh?

28:06.390 --> 28:07.540
Unbelievable.

28:08.190 --> 28:09.300
Come, sit down.

28:12.020 --> 28:12.710
There are some things

28:12.710 --> 28:14.170
I need to make clear to you.

28:16.950 --> 28:19.600
Stop calling yourself a mama's boy.

28:19.910 --> 28:21.640
Do you know what a mama's boy is?

28:22.780 --> 28:24.110
A so-called mama's boy

28:24.110 --> 28:25.740
is someone who only listens to his mother,

28:25.740 --> 28:27.910
thinks she is always right,

28:27.940 --> 28:29.970
and is spoiled by her.

28:31.870 --> 28:33.000
Think about it, Jun.

28:33.820 --> 28:35.220
Since middle school,

28:35.300 --> 28:36.540
which of your decisions

28:36.540 --> 28:38.000
has your mom forced on you?

28:38.710 --> 28:39.820
Which of your choices

28:39.820 --> 28:42.360
hasn't been made after fully considering

28:42.380 --> 28:44.460
your personal situation

28:44.490 --> 28:46.620
and respecting your personal wishes?

28:48.020 --> 28:50.320
Your mother just wants to see

28:50.340 --> 28:51.690
a healthy and happy you,

28:51.720 --> 28:52.760
my son.

28:58.190 --> 28:58.790
Of course.

28:59.460 --> 29:00.260
In our family,

29:00.390 --> 29:02.380
your mom always puts you first.

29:02.950 --> 29:03.740
If you think

29:03.740 --> 29:05.020
that makes you a mama's boy,

29:05.020 --> 29:06.820
then I'm sorry to tell you

29:07.220 --> 29:08.740
that most boys in the world

29:08.740 --> 29:09.670
are mama's boys.

29:20.710 --> 29:21.840
What are you doing? Don't come here.

29:21.840 --> 29:23.100
What are you doing? Don't touch me.

29:23.100 --> 29:24.870
What are you doing? Don't touch me!

29:24.870 --> 29:25.780
-Mom, Mom.
-Don't touch me!

29:25.780 --> 29:27.670
I was wrong. I was wrong.

29:27.670 --> 29:28.630
Go away!

29:28.630 --> 29:30.430
I was wrong. I was wrong.

29:31.190 --> 29:32.540
Your mom didn't do this

29:32.670 --> 29:35.160
to help Dang Yu.

29:36.710 --> 29:37.870
Then why?

29:37.910 --> 29:39.560
What was it for?

29:40.260 --> 29:44.050
The sub-district organized a challenge

29:44.080 --> 29:46.880
between our square dance
and their hip-hop dance.

29:46.910 --> 29:48.020
So I thought,

29:48.020 --> 29:49.820
if Dang Yu insists on competing,

29:49.820 --> 29:51.910
I need to hurry up and practice.

29:51.910 --> 29:52.860
Right.

29:53.710 --> 29:55.620
Mom, you didn't think

29:55.640 --> 29:57.780
you'd be competing against
Dang Yu's team, did you?

29:57.780 --> 29:58.700
What else?

30:00.260 --> 30:01.950
You are on the same team.

30:02.020 --> 30:04.880
-How is that possible?
-Two dance genres are a team,

30:04.950 --> 30:07.480
participating in the competition together.

30:08.300 --> 30:09.670
What would that look like?

30:09.670 --> 30:10.950
Like a mishmash.

30:10.970 --> 30:11.730
Really.

30:11.780 --> 30:13.690
Mom, you don't understand.

30:13.720 --> 30:15.500
This shows our mutual understanding

30:15.500 --> 30:17.270
and tolerance for each other.

30:17.300 --> 30:18.050
Right.

30:18.210 --> 30:20.050
Very creative.

30:23.950 --> 30:25.530
By the way, Dad, Mom,

30:25.670 --> 30:26.540
I actually have something else

30:26.540 --> 30:27.590
I want to tell you.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.520
For the Spring Festival this year,

30:30.540 --> 30:32.290
I'm going to Dang Yu's house.

30:32.460 --> 30:33.310
No way.

30:33.340 --> 30:33.780
No way.

30:33.780 --> 30:34.590
-It's impossible.
-No.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.300
Absolutely no.

30:35.300 --> 30:36.260
That's absolutely impossible.

30:36.260 --> 30:39.720
How can you go to someone else's
house for the Spring Festival?

30:44.300 --> 30:45.450
Listen to me first.

30:45.630 --> 30:46.840
I'm going to Yunnan,

30:47.020 --> 30:48.380
all for your sake.

30:48.910 --> 30:49.770
Think about it.

30:49.780 --> 30:51.390
The scenery in Yunnan is beautiful,

30:51.390 --> 30:53.350
and there are many friends
from ethnic minorities.

30:53.350 --> 30:54.350
After I go there,

30:54.380 --> 30:56.640
I can shoot some videos of local customs.

30:56.780 --> 30:58.280
When it's time for your competition,

30:58.280 --> 31:00.110
we can just play them in the background.

31:00.110 --> 31:01.980
It will be cool and add extra points.

31:01.980 --> 31:03.820
Winning the grand prize is a sure thing.

31:03.820 --> 31:05.680
By then, if my leader is happy,

31:05.700 --> 31:06.980
maybe they will even

31:06.980 --> 31:08.220
add a good mark to my record.

31:08.220 --> 31:09.230
Don't you agree?

31:34.350 --> 31:35.280
Why are you here?

31:36.370 --> 31:38.780
I heard someone needed help,

31:38.890 --> 31:40.950
so I rushed over without hesitation.

31:41.350 --> 31:42.280
Let's get this straight.

31:42.280 --> 31:43.160
My main purpose for this trip

31:43.160 --> 31:45.150
is to shoot some background videos
in Yunnan

31:45.150 --> 31:47.160
for the dance competition.

31:47.300 --> 31:49.500
The sub-district leaders approved it.

31:50.540 --> 31:51.780
Secondly,

31:52.060 --> 31:53.820
it's to help you deal with
your parents and relatives

31:53.820 --> 31:55.350
pushing you to get married.

31:55.930 --> 31:57.530
It's also mainly to thank you

31:57.540 --> 32:00.870
for joining the sub-district dance team
as an external aid.

32:01.080 --> 32:02.280
First of all,

32:02.780 --> 32:04.560
your video shooting
has nothing to do with me.

32:04.560 --> 32:06.380
I'm only responsible for dancing.

32:06.380 --> 32:07.470
Secondly,

32:07.590 --> 32:09.810
I'm not afraid of my parents
pushing me to get married.

32:09.810 --> 32:11.530
It's just to shut my sister up.

32:16.020 --> 32:17.350
But I'm really curious.

32:18.020 --> 32:19.280
How did your mom agree?

32:20.880 --> 32:22.450
My mom...

32:25.780 --> 32:28.130
It's a secret.

32:39.260 --> 32:40.740
We're here. This is it.

32:41.260 --> 32:43.460
I'll kill you if you talk nonsense later.

32:43.460 --> 32:44.260
I know. I know.

32:44.430 --> 32:45.160
Don't worry.

33:14.910 --> 33:17.010
Here comes the fish.

33:17.590 --> 33:19.280
It tastes like home.

33:20.080 --> 33:21.320
Jun, sit.

33:22.840 --> 33:24.330
Dear, eat up.

33:24.430 --> 33:26.360
These are all my signature dishes.

33:28.030 --> 33:28.760
Eat up.

33:32.870 --> 33:34.470
Jun, start eating.

33:34.980 --> 33:36.080
Here, have some.

33:36.530 --> 33:38.190
Yu, get some food for Jun.

33:39.670 --> 33:41.070
Come on, you guys eat too.

33:47.020 --> 33:47.630
Sister.

33:48.390 --> 33:49.590
What does your new boyfriend

33:49.590 --> 33:50.630
do for a living?

33:51.470 --> 33:53.070
I'm a civil servant.

33:53.740 --> 33:54.730
Uncle, Auntie,

33:54.860 --> 33:56.390
I'm a Shanghai native.

33:56.640 --> 33:57.720
I'm an only child.

33:57.920 --> 34:00.250
My parents are healthy and fully insured.

34:01.340 --> 34:02.540
An only child.

34:02.710 --> 34:04.970
Then she's even less likely to come home.

34:05.010 --> 34:05.940
That's fine too.

34:06.850 --> 34:09.050
I didn't expect her to come back anyway.

34:10.389 --> 34:11.980
Not at all. Yu and I

34:12.010 --> 34:14.070
will definitely visit you two often.

34:14.380 --> 34:15.340
Good, good.

34:21.030 --> 34:21.739
Sister,

34:22.340 --> 34:24.480
I remember you were single.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.739
How come you got a boyfriend

34:25.739 --> 34:26.940
in just a few days?

34:27.150 --> 34:28.420
Have you been dating someone

34:28.420 --> 34:29.420
and lying to us?

34:29.820 --> 34:31.530
What's there to hide?

34:31.560 --> 34:33.780
Are you afraid
we'll take advantage of you?

34:33.780 --> 34:35.040
Why would I lie to you?

34:35.340 --> 34:36.370
Jun and I

34:36.780 --> 34:38.500
fell in love at first sight recently,

34:38.500 --> 34:39.960
so things moved a bit fast.

34:40.449 --> 34:41.179
Right, babe?

34:41.739 --> 34:42.980
Right, right, right.

34:43.130 --> 34:45.170
We are just meant to be.

34:45.199 --> 34:46.239
Good.

34:46.670 --> 34:47.650
Brother-in-Law,

34:47.650 --> 34:49.420
since you are at our house now,

34:49.550 --> 34:50.710
when do you and my sister

34:50.710 --> 34:51.989
plan to get married?

34:52.320 --> 34:53.030
If you get married,

34:53.030 --> 34:54.889
you need to pay a bride price here.

34:54.889 --> 34:56.889
It's even more if you marry far away.

34:57.270 --> 34:58.690
Watch your words.

34:59.420 --> 35:00.260
Well,

35:00.630 --> 35:01.650
I'll listen to your sister.

35:01.650 --> 35:03.030
I'll follow her arrangement.

35:03.030 --> 35:03.780
Really?

35:03.800 --> 35:05.910
Speaking of the bride price,

35:05.930 --> 35:07.400
I need to calculate it carefully.

35:07.400 --> 35:09.780
I've been taking care of
our parents all these years.

35:09.780 --> 35:11.590
Your bride price

35:11.590 --> 35:14.220
should definitely
compensate for that, right?

35:14.220 --> 35:15.070
You want to calculate with me?

35:15.070 --> 35:16.530
Come on, let's calculate.

35:17.130 --> 35:19.010
I send money home every month.

35:19.120 --> 35:21.030
It must have been a lot over the years.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.860
And you? How long since you graduated?

35:22.860 --> 35:25.120
Why are you still living off our parents?

35:25.610 --> 35:26.940
I'm not living off them.

35:27.220 --> 35:27.820
It's just because

35:27.820 --> 35:29.150
I haven't found a suitable job.

35:29.150 --> 35:30.010
Did you even look for one?

35:30.010 --> 35:32.010
-Enough.
-I'm still looking for it.

35:34.030 --> 35:35.230
You rarely come back.

35:35.820 --> 35:38.590
What are you arguing with your sister
about as soon as you're home?

35:38.590 --> 35:40.730
Dad, I wasn't arguing with her.

35:40.760 --> 35:42.360
We were just messing around.

35:43.070 --> 35:45.110
Old man, this is what you like to eat.

35:45.130 --> 35:45.490
Here.

35:46.780 --> 35:47.970
Uncle, Auntie.

35:48.110 --> 35:49.710
I know you raised Yu

35:49.730 --> 35:51.040
with a lot of effort.

35:51.380 --> 35:53.590
In the future, I will definitely
look after

35:53.590 --> 35:54.920
and treat you with all my respect with Yu.

35:54.920 --> 35:56.270
Good.

35:57.260 --> 35:58.590
You're quite a talker.

35:59.340 --> 35:59.940
Uncle.

36:01.860 --> 36:03.070
Cheers, old man.

36:08.250 --> 36:09.410
Slow down, Jun.

36:11.550 --> 36:12.350
Eat your food.

36:19.340 --> 36:21.150
Didn't you buy a gift for my dad?

36:21.220 --> 36:21.820
Go get it.

36:29.740 --> 36:30.300
Uncle,

36:30.530 --> 36:32.730
this is the sea cucumber we brought you.

36:34.350 --> 36:35.860
This is too expensive.

36:36.030 --> 36:37.590
Thank you, my second child.

36:37.610 --> 36:39.380
I haven't loved you for nothing.

36:39.380 --> 36:40.670
It's what I should do, Dad.

36:40.670 --> 36:42.630
You raised me up, and it wasn't easy.

36:42.630 --> 36:43.910
I know you're not in good health,

36:43.910 --> 36:46.030
so I bought these things
for you to nourish yourself.

36:46.030 --> 36:47.340
Am I right, Sister?

36:50.350 --> 36:50.990
Thank you.

36:51.010 --> 36:51.810
It's nothing.

36:54.780 --> 36:55.470
Uncle,

36:55.710 --> 36:58.640
this is a little token of appreciation
from Yu and me.

37:04.860 --> 37:06.920
It might not be worth much,

37:06.940 --> 37:08.810
but if you find it useful,

37:08.900 --> 37:09.940
Yu and I

37:09.940 --> 37:11.800
will bring you more in the future.

37:12.250 --> 37:14.290
Jun, you're being too polite.

37:14.310 --> 37:15.320
No, not at all.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.260
You really don't need my help?

37:29.680 --> 37:30.620
Come on.

37:30.650 --> 37:31.560
If I let you help,

37:31.560 --> 37:33.360
my dad would blow up again later.

37:38.450 --> 37:40.450
Where did you get so much cordyceps?

37:42.760 --> 37:43.560
Before I left,

37:43.570 --> 37:45.370
I stole it from my mom's cabinet.

37:45.420 --> 37:46.490
At that time, I felt

37:46.510 --> 37:48.440
it would definitely come in handy.

37:49.040 --> 37:50.010
How much is it?

37:50.550 --> 37:52.610
I'll transfer the money to you later.

37:53.670 --> 37:55.200
No need. It's a gift for you.

37:55.420 --> 37:56.580
That won't do.

37:57.100 --> 37:58.360
Business is business.

37:58.980 --> 38:00.040
Otherwise, when you go back,

38:00.040 --> 38:01.440
how are you going
to explain it to your mom?

38:01.440 --> 38:03.260
I'll just tell my mom later

38:03.290 --> 38:04.970
that this is all a necessary sacrifice

38:04.970 --> 38:06.420
for the dance competition.

38:06.420 --> 38:07.960
She will definitely support me.

38:07.960 --> 38:10.620
Your mom values that dance competition
so much?

38:11.220 --> 38:12.710
I'm in charge of our sub-district

38:12.710 --> 38:14.640
for the district dance competition
after the new year.

38:14.640 --> 38:16.920
My mom thinks that
if we can get a good result,

38:16.920 --> 38:18.580
it'll help me get a promotion.

38:18.710 --> 38:20.860
So as long as it's related to this,

38:20.890 --> 38:21.980
she puts it first.

38:23.140 --> 38:24.170
Sometimes,

38:25.150 --> 38:26.180
I quite envy you.

38:27.530 --> 38:28.360
Envy me?

38:28.390 --> 38:29.470
Envy me for what?

38:32.670 --> 38:33.430
Jun.

38:35.340 --> 38:36.330
Yu, hold off on the dishes for now.

38:36.330 --> 38:37.460
Let me chat with Jun.

38:39.300 --> 38:41.440
But I haven't finished washing the dishes.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.040
It's fine.

38:42.040 --> 38:43.240
I'll wash them later.

39:34.970 --> 39:35.990
[New Year's Eve dinner]

39:43.340 --> 39:43.400
[Forward]

39:43.400 --> 39:45.160
[Send to Qian Fei]

39:45.230 --> 39:45.620
[Sent]

39:46.570 --> 39:47.560
[New Year's Eve dinner]

39:47.650 --> 39:49.460
[Qian Fei]

39:53.740 --> 39:56.280
[When you come back,
make the same one for me.]

39:56.300 --> 39:57.100
[Jinzi]

40:02.550 --> 40:03.150
Hello?

40:03.550 --> 40:04.470
Yifei,

40:04.860 --> 40:06.750
I'm on the pedestrian street
near your apartment,

40:06.750 --> 40:08.680
recording a Spring Festival vlog.

40:09.300 --> 40:11.340
My stomach suddenly hurts terribly.

40:11.340 --> 40:13.160
Could you come help me?

40:14.420 --> 40:14.820
I...

40:16.560 --> 40:18.220
But I'm really busy right now.

40:18.870 --> 40:20.880
Call Zihao. He's totally free.

40:20.990 --> 40:21.990
He'll go help you.

40:23.030 --> 40:24.340
But my phone is dying.

40:24.340 --> 40:25.670
It's about to shut down.

40:26.150 --> 40:29.480
My stomach hurts too much
to find a place to rent a power bank.

40:29.930 --> 40:33.330
I'm right here at the intersection
of the pedestrian street.

40:33.340 --> 40:35.030
Yifei, I...

40:35.230 --> 40:36.630
It's okay. You... you...

40:37.190 --> 40:37.820
Hello?

40:44.620 --> 40:44.930
[Recent calls]

40:44.960 --> 40:45.510
[Jinzi]

40:53.070 --> 40:54.200
It really shut down.

41:04.770 --> 41:05.970
Please open the door.

41:07.290 --> 41:08.150
Please come in.

41:12.580 --> 41:14.310
It's okay. Take a seat for a bit.

41:16.840 --> 41:17.970
Here's a power bank.

41:19.430 --> 41:22.030
I'll go get you some water
to take your medicine.

41:22.030 --> 41:23.140
Thank you, Yifei.

41:34.070 --> 41:35.340
Is this how you usually

41:35.340 --> 41:36.870
take care of your landlady?

41:38.220 --> 41:40.020
I think she takes care of me more.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.630
Then does she like you?

41:43.140 --> 41:43.830
She...

41:45.300 --> 41:46.740
she's a tomboy.

41:47.470 --> 41:49.470
She probably just sees me as a buddy.

41:55.930 --> 41:57.700
Judging from this room's decor,

41:57.700 --> 41:59.560
it really lacks a feminine touch.

42:01.080 --> 42:03.540
Decor is a personal preference.

42:06.350 --> 42:07.480
Take your medicine.

42:07.790 --> 42:08.270
Okay.

42:19.700 --> 42:20.630
Can you

42:20.650 --> 42:22.110
make me a bowl of porridge?

42:24.070 --> 42:25.270
I want some porridge.

42:27.760 --> 42:28.330
I...

42:28.540 --> 42:29.420
I... I...

42:29.510 --> 42:31.370
Do I look like I can make porridge?

42:34.510 --> 42:36.430
Let me order takeout for you.

42:36.460 --> 42:37.720
No, don't order.

42:37.940 --> 42:38.710
It's the middle of the night.

42:38.710 --> 42:40.910
It's not easy for delivery guys either.

42:44.260 --> 42:46.250
Well, I can teach you.

42:46.710 --> 42:48.040
Do you have rice at home?

42:52.100 --> 42:53.570
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.030 --> 42:55.200
Today

42:55.780 --> 42:57.360
seems to be February 14.

42:57.780 --> 42:58.470
Are you

42:58.570 --> 43:00.770
here to wish me a happy Valentine's Day?

43:00.860 --> 43:01.600
Is it?

43:01.940 --> 43:03.200
How come I didn't know?

43:03.670 --> 43:04.160
I...

43:04.590 --> 43:05.980
Are you shopping?

43:06.860 --> 43:07.740
I'll let you go then.

43:07.740 --> 43:09.140
I'm hanging up. Bye-bye.

43:09.820 --> 43:10.400
Speak.

43:10.670 --> 43:11.610
Hey, Li Yifei.

43:11.900 --> 43:14.110
The mobile app suddenly got a bug.

43:14.630 --> 43:15.990
The capital chain broke again.

43:15.990 --> 43:18.300
The remaining money
isn't enough to fix it.

43:18.300 --> 43:20.300
Shouldn't we start thinking of a way

43:20.310 --> 43:21.930
to get financing?
